                <pb facs="0817" n="723" sameAs="frus:frus1887/pg723"/>

                <head>No. 466.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Manning to Mr. Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1887-05-11"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 11, 1887</date>.
                        (Received May 11.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Dispatch stating shooting of Nogales rescuers premature.</p>
                <p>They have appealed.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Manning.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
